sentences.text:
Hence, following order:
a) In the event of arrest of the applicant in connection with C.R. No.245 of 2023 registered with Wakad Police Station, District Pune for offences punishable under Section 420, 417, 464, 465, 468, 379 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860, she be released on interim bail on furnishing P.R. Bond in the amount of Rs.50,000/- along with one or two sureties in the like amount;
b) The applicant shall appear before the investigating officer on 21, 23 and 26 June 2023 and thereafter as and when called by the investigating officer;
910-aba1674-2023.doc c) The applicant shall not directly or indirectly make any inducement, threat or promise to any witness acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade him from disclosing such facts to the court or to any police officer;
d) The applicant shall not obstruct or hamper the police investigation and not to play mischief with the evidence collected or yet to be collected by the police;
5. List the anticipatory bail application on 17 July 2023.

